 arsenal's  mom tells her the police found the dead  body of a boy in the river shocked by  the news she refuses to accept it shun  mr morisaki the substitute teacher is  giving a lecture on a book when he  mentions agatha the land of the dead  which catches asuna's attention she goes  to the teacher after school and asks him  about agartha the teacher explains that  long ago when humanity was young it  needed the supervision of ancient gods  the same monster that shun saved her  from until the humanity grew up and the  existence of the gods was no longer  necessary they hide themselves as  gatekeepers of the underworld it's said  to be a place where any kind of wish can  be fulfilled even resurrecting the dead  arsenal leaves her teacher's place and  returns home considering what they've  discussed but she's interrupted when her  cat mimi chases after a glittering  object at her hangout leading her to  shin a boy who looks precisely like shun  and holds the same crystal as shun did  but has a colder disposition  while talking the archangels a group of  men emerge at that very moment and  attack both they're hoping to find a  garther on their own when the cave's  entrance is bombarded the strange boy  hides with arsuna in the underground  entrance and the two go deeper into the  cave  inside the cave they come across a  gatekeeper who appears to have lost his  bodily senses and attacks the youngster  he refuses to murder the gatekeeper and  instead gives arsenal his clavis a  crystal and runs back to fight the  monster when he thought he'd won the  fight the monster attacks him and  injures asuna rushes and tries to  protect him at the very last moment the  archangels intervene and they end up  killing the gatekeeper the archangel  commander catches asuna and opens a  portal to agartha with the clavis the  commander and asuna are the first to  enter the portal followed by the boy  once they reach inside the mysterious  commander exposes he's none other than  mr morisaki the substitute teacher the  young lad is shin shoon's little brother  hence the resemblance the teacher tells  the boy that he wishes to bring his wife  back to life shin tells asuna that shun  is dead and that she doesn't need a  clevis to open the exit portal then the  boy submerges into the ocean mr morisaki  explains that he's part of the archangel  and has been researching the land of  agartha for 10 years the organization  doesn't have good intentions though the  teacher offers asuna the option of  returning home but she chooses to tag  along they both enter the realm through  an underwater portal once they reach  inside the duo and mimi who had smuggled  herself into asuna's backpack traveled  to the gate of life and death which may  bring the souls of the dead back to life  when shin returns to his village he's  informed that he failed his mission to  retrieve the clavis because asuna had  with her the crystal from the radio and  that she could open the gates any time  shin must now go back and stop her and  the teacher from unleashing chaos along  the way arsenal is kidnapped by strange  monsters suddenly she wakes up in a  confined space and finds another little  girl who happens to be kidnapped as well  the two get along quickly and decide to  run away as the day grows darker the  monsters emerge but they can only move  in the shadows the two girls meet shin  during their escape attempt who try to  help them but is wounded by the monsters  morisaki becomes successful in finding  them with mimi's help shin tries to grab  clavic's crystal fragment from the  teacher however he's too weak to fight  back and morisaki quickly overcomes him  later they're headed to the little girls  village when they arrive the natives are  initially hesitant to assist the top  dwellers but the village leader  persuades the guards to let them in  because they've brought the little girl  back the elder lets them stay one night  in the hamlet but they're not allowed to  stay 